 7. ⛳️ Trump reveals golf course grand vision 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Via Truth Social President Trump announced controversial plans to renovate the public East Potomac Golf Course in D.C. to a "World Class Championship Golf Course," despite a federal judge's orders to pause plans.

 Trump said construction would begin in November and that the new course will open in about 15 months. Friction point: Following Trump's Truth Social post, the U.S. district judge on the case ordered the administration to answer whether it still plans to argue that designs for East Potomac are just "preliminary."

